                                                "sense_id": "81df4294-c760-3964-b00a-1ea06bf5f0a2",
                                                "text": "Inwardly Okonkwo knew that the boys were still too young to understand fully the difficult art of preparing seed-yams. But he thought that one could not begin too early. Yam stood for manliness, and he who could feed his family on yams from one harvest to another was a very great man indeed."
                                            }
