                                                "sense_id": "ef6c910c-104f-3ce4-8703-18514c58fb22",
                                                "text": "“Stay, jailer, stay, and hear my woe,” repeating again and again, very softly, the line at the end of each stanza, “I am not mad, I am not mad.”\n Except she sang it:\n “I yam not mad, I yam not mad.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
